      "updated_at": "2017-07-02T15:40:13Z",
      "body": "Requiring a verified e-mail address is an important step for weeding out spam/automated accounts, and it makes creating sockpuppets slightly more tedious. You might be interested in #942 and related issues, i.e. sourcing user accounts from a different database. However, for local sign ups, e-mail will remain a required component.",
