      "created_at": "2022-01-28T20:08:59Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-01-28T20:08:59Z",
      "body": "Whether to allow users register without email should be determined by the instance admins, not hardcoded in the software.\r\n\r\nNot having a way to disable email requirement is the biggest reason why I no longer use Mastodon.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
